+Carbon accounting & carbon-aware scheduling for Aegis
+
+This directory contains tooling to:
+- measure/estimate job energy (kWh) and convert to CO2e (kg)
+- query grid emission factors (ElectricityMap) with a static fallback
+- admission webhook to enforce per-project carbon budgets
+- a carbon-aware scheduler helper to pick lower-carbon regions/times
+- an auditor packager extension to include signed CO2e fields in PoA bundles
+- an autoscaler hook to recommend greener instance types
+
+All network APIs require secrets/API keys. Use environment variables:
+- ELECTRICITYMAP_API_KEY - ElectricityMap REST API key (optional)
+- REDIS_URL - budget + cache store (used by webhook)
+- COSIGN_KMS_URI / REKOR_SERVER - for signing auditor bundles
+
+Quick start:
+1. Deploy Redis and configure REDIS_URL.
+2. Add ElectricityMap API key or populate ops/carbon/convert/default_emissions.json.
+3. Hook job_carbon_exporter.py into training/PoA job post-run to record energy & CO2e.
+4. Deploy carbon_budget_webhook as an admission webhook (demo stub).
+5. Use carbon_audit_packager.py to include carbon fields in auditor bundles.
