+# Carbon accounting runbook (Aegis)
+
+Prereqs:
+- REDIS_URL set for budget webhook
+- ELECTRICITYMAP_API_KEY set (optional) or default_emissions.json populated
+- PUSHGATEWAY configured for metrics ingestion (optional)
+- COSIGN_KMS_URI and S3_UPLOAD for signed audit bundles
+
+1) Instrument jobs to write carbon artifact
+ - After training/PoA jobs finish, call:
+   python3 ops/carbon/exporter/job_carbon_exporter.py --job-id JOB123 --start 1670000000 --end 1670003000 --region us-west-2 --instance-type p4d.24xlarge --gpu-hours 4 --pushgateway http://pushgateway:9091
+
+2) Create auditor carbon bundle
+ - Example:
+   python3 ops/carbon/audit/carbon_audit_packager.py --artifacts /tmp/carbon_job_JOB123.json --out /tmp/carbon_audit_JOB123.tar.gz --cosign-key "$COSIGN_KMS_URI" --s3 "$S3_UPLOAD"
+
+3) Deploy carbon budget webhook (demo)
+ - Run on a small host:
+   python3 ops/carbon/webhook/carbon_budget_webhook.py
+ - Configure K8s AdmissionWebhook to call it (TLS and auth required in prod)
+ - Set budgets in Redis: redis-cli SET budget:my-namespace 500.0
+
+4) Use carbon_aware_scheduler for batch submissions
+ - Example:
+   python3 ops/carbon/scheduler/carbon_aware_scheduler.py --job-json job.json --candidates us-west-2,us-east-1 --out job_region.json
+
+5) Autoscaler recommendation
+ - Test:
+   python3 ops/carbon/autoscaler/carbon_aware_autoscaler.py --candidates p4d.24xlarge,p3.16xlarge --region us-west-2 --runtime-hours 2 --gpu-hours 4
+
+6) Dashboards
+ - Import ops/monitoring/grafana/carbon_dashboard.json into Grafana
+ - Add alerts based on aegis_job_co2e_kg and cumulative budgets
+
